title: "FIG. 69-02: Edge Trigger Flow"
patent: EGS-69
---
flowchart LR
    A[Edge Updated] --> B{Trigger Condition Met?}
    B -->|"Yes"| C[Queue Target Node]
    B -->|"No"| D[No Action]
    
    C --> E{Check Dependencies}
    E -->|"All Ready"| F[Execute Node]
    E -->|"Waiting"| G[Add to Pending]
    
    F --> H[Update Node State]
    H --> I[Propagate to Outbound Edges]
    I --> J{More Triggers?}
    J -->|"Yes"| A
    J -->|"No"| K[Execution Complete]
    
    G --> L[Wait for Dependencies]
    L --> E
